OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA largely dry, chilly start
OL,6,Fwith long sunny spells. Cloud
OL,7,Fincreases towards midday, and winds
OL,8,Fturn more northwesterly and freshen,
OL,9,Fbringing occasionally heavy afternoon
OL,10,Fshowers, these turning wintry over
OL,11,Fhigher mountains.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers becoming increasingly
OL,14,Fconfined to northern and eastern
OL,15,FAberdeenshire overnight. Long clear
OL,16,Fspells develop in south and west, with
OL,17,Fa touch of frost possible in well
OL,18,Fsheltered spots.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
