OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F177A1791345334
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA few early showers in
OL,6,Fnortheast, otherwise a chilly start
OL,7,Fwith sunny spells. Increasing cloud
OL,8,Fbrings outbreaks of rain east through
OL,9,Fthe late afternoon and evening.
OL,10,FFreshening southerly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:
OL,13,FOccasionally heavy rain clearing
OL,14,Fovernight then sunny spells and
OL,15,Fblustery showers Friday, the showers
OL,16,Fbecoming heavier, more frequent
OL,17,FSaturday with northwesterly coastal
OL,18,Fgales. Mainly dry and bright Sunday,
OL,19,Fwinds easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
